  "quotes": [
    {
      "quote": "Can coding agents stay coherent over a billion token budget? Can they build Slack from scratch? Can they rewrite an entire JAX code base in PyTorch? Can they build a C compiler in Rust?",
      "timestamp_sec": 1,
      "talk_slug": "swe-marathon-evaluating-coding-agents-at-billion-token-scale",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Rx8f05JI_WA&t=1s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "The pattern is that coding agents are being pointed at whole projects, not just GitHub issues or linear tickets.",
      "timestamp_sec": 48,
      "talk_slug": "swe-marathon-evaluating-coding-agents-at-billion-token-scale",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Rx8f05JI_WA&t=48s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "These are literally hundreds of hours of human work compressed into a single agent rollout.",
      "timestamp_sec": 112,
      "talk_slug": "swe-marathon-evaluating-coding-agents-at-billion-token-scale",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Rx8f05JI_WA&t=112s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "In a short benchmark, a weak test could just be considered as noise. But, in a multi-hour environment, a weak verifier becomes an attack surface.",
      "timestamp_sec": 112,
      "talk_slug": "swe-marathon-evaluating-coding-agents-at-billion-token-scale",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Rx8f05JI_WA&t=112s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "The agent has hours, a file system, unrestricted network access potentially, and a reward signal.",
      "timestamp_sec": 171,
      "talk_slug": "swe-marathon-evaluating-coding-agents-at-billion-token-scale",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Rx8f05JI_WA&t=171s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "We wanted independent verified channels that fail in different ways.",
      "timestamp_sec": 171,
      "talk_slug": "swe-marathon-evaluating-coding-agents-at-billion-token-scale",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Rx8f05JI_WA&t=171s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "Unit test can pass, but the product is probably still unusable and the front end looks terrible.",
      "timestamp_sec": 236,
      "talk_slug": "swe-marathon-evaluating-coding-agents-at-billion-token-scale",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Rx8f05JI_WA&t=236s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "The verifier isn't reading code or calling an API directly. It's driving the submitted slack clone through the UI.",
      "timestamp_sec": 236,
      "talk_slug": "swe-marathon-evaluating-coding-agents-at-billion-token-scale",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Rx8f05JI_WA&t=236s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "full stack eval's are hard because correctness is not just an API contract. It's whether the user can actually complete the product's intended workflow.",
      "timestamp_sec": 290,
      "talk_slug": "swe-marathon-evaluating-coding-agents-at-billion-token-scale",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Rx8f05JI_WA&t=290s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "The best configuration here is Claude Opus 4.8 with Claude Code, and it only achieves a 26% resolution rate.",
      "timestamp_sec": 345,
      "talk_slug": "swe-marathon-evaluating-coding-agents-at-billion-token-scale",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Rx8f05JI_WA&t=345s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "The average trial used 31 million tokens, and the longest rollout consumed 877 million tokens.",
      "timestamp_sec": 345,
      "talk_slug": "swe-marathon-evaluating-coding-agents-at-billion-token-scale",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Rx8f05JI_WA&t=345s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "current agents are very impressive, but end-to-end project ownership ownership is still very far from being solved",
      "timestamp_sec": 403,
      "talk_slug": "swe-marathon-evaluating-coding-agents-at-billion-token-scale",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Rx8f05JI_WA&t=403s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "Whereas GPT 4.5 with Codex is far cheaper and only gets 12%. So, the model isn't just the full picture. The agent scaffold makes a huge difference",
      "timestamp_sec": 403,
      "talk_slug": "swe-marathon-evaluating-coding-agents-at-billion-token-scale",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Rx8f05JI_WA&t=403s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "Reward hacking is an arms race between coding agents and our environment. This is why strong verifiers are are central to Sweep Marathon's task design and not an afterthought.",
      "timestamp_sec": 524,
      "talk_slug": "swe-marathon-evaluating-coding-agents-at-billion-token-scale",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Rx8f05JI_WA&t=524s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "we found 12.8% had suspicious shortcut behavior, and 9% had the clear verifier bypass",
      "timestamp_sec": 582,
      "talk_slug": "swe-marathon-evaluating-coding-agents-at-billion-token-scale",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Rx8f05JI_WA&t=582s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "Zero rollouts earned reward through an exploit, because our defenses caught them. That should be the bar for long-horizon evals.",
      "timestamp_sec": 582,
      "talk_slug": "swe-marathon-evaluating-coding-agents-at-billion-token-scale",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Rx8f05JI_WA&t=582s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "But Gemini found a much shorter implementation strategy, which is call GCC from inside the Rust program.",
      "timestamp_sec": 582,
      "talk_slug": "swe-marathon-evaluating-coding-agents-at-billion-token-scale",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Rx8f05JI_WA&t=582s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "So, even though the partial scores look high, the final reward is zero.",
      "timestamp_sec": 643,
      "talk_slug": "swe-marathon-evaluating-coding-agents-at-billion-token-scale",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Rx8f05JI_WA&t=643s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "the future of SWE evals is not just harder unit tests. Once agents run for hours, each task becomes a complex environment",
      "timestamp_sec": 643,
      "talk_slug": "swe-marathon-evaluating-coding-agents-at-billion-token-scale",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Rx8f05JI_WA&t=643s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
